WEBVTT

00:13.968 --> 00:21.950
He's not angry, he's overwhelmed I see the

00:22.030 --> 00:31.508
signs, I know this pain The static flooding in

00:32.348 --> 00:37.390
Your brain, it's not a choice It's not a fight,

00:37.770 --> 00:42.412
it's not a flaw It's just the world and all it's

00:42.532 --> 00:47.274
wrong Hmm,

00:47.874 --> 00:53.356
hmm, hmm Hmm, hmm, hmm

00:58.556 --> 01:05.881
It's okay, you're safe Focus on my voice This

01:06.001 --> 01:12.465
isn't a trap, you have a choice Just breathe

01:14.886 --> 01:20.109
Aubrey, my name is Aubrey Is it okay if I put my

01:20.149 --> 01:21.010
hand on your shoulder?

01:23.752 --> 01:27.234
Is it okay if I hug you?

01:37.894 --> 01:41.876
I know

01:44.498 --> 01:48.000
you're not

02:06.738 --> 02:14.282
The storm has passed, you're safe, you're

02:14.302 --> 02:20.204
all The first unconditional, the first real hug

02:21.885 --> 02:22.686
You're safe

02:26.948 --> 02:27.688
You're safe

02:35.512 --> 02:36.252
You're safe

